{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55463","headline":"游南雁荡诗 · 陈德诚","name":"游南雁荡诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁山遥与白云连，六十奇峯半倚天。\n金鼎雨花猿听偈，石门迎月鹤参禅。\n戏龙高跃青霄上，羣凤齐飞赤日边。\n诗思凭空吟不了，那堪夙驾入星躔。\n（见周喟《南雁荡山志》卷一引陈玭《嘉靖南雁山志》、郑思恭《崇祯南雁山志》等。\n）（按：陈德诚逸诗及小传，皆承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈德诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}